{
  "id": "01_4977",
  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "MG 1/100 ガンダムベース限定 ドム[クリアカラー]",
    "en": "MG 1/100 Gundam Base Limited Dom [Clear Color]"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 5500,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2023年05月03日 (水)",
    "year": 2023,
    "month": 5,
    "day": 3
  },
  "targetAge": 15,
  "scale": "1/100",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "全世界のガンプラファンにむけた、公式ガンプラ総合施設「ガンダムベース」の限定ガンプラです。",
      "en": "A limited edition Gunpla at the official Gunpla facility \"Gundam Base\" for Gunpla fans around the world."
    },
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム』より、MG 1/100 ドムがクリアカラーで登場！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", MG 1/100 Dom is now available in clear color!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 外装の成形色がクリアカラーに変更され、メタリック成形色に変更した内部フレームなどのディティールがより際立つ仕上がりに。",
      "en": "• The exterior molding color has been changed to a clear color, and details such as the internal frame, which has been changed to a metallic molding color, stand out more."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩と胴体の接続部に前方へのスイング機構を実装。ジャイアント・バズを構える印象的なポーズが各部の干渉を軽減しスムーズに決まる。",
      "en": "• A forward swing mechanism is implemented at the connection between the shoulder and torso. The impressive pose of holding the Giant Buzz is achieved smoothly by reducing interference between various parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 股関節には新たにスイング可動構造を採用。さらに太腿の接続部に軸可動を追加、腰サイドアーマー更新により、脚部の可動域が大幅に拡大。",
      "en": "• A new swing movable structure has been adopted for the hip joint. Additionally, axis movement has been added to the thigh joints, and the waist side armor has been updated to greatly expand the range of motion of the legs."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ジャイアント・バズをはじめ、ラケーテン・バズ、シュツルム・ファウストなど豊富な武装が付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a variety of weapons including Giant Buzz, Raketen Buzz, and Sturm Faust."
    }
  ],
